            <h3 data-hf-id="hf-ccen" id="doc-heading">Construire sa première page</h3>
            <p data-hf-id="hf-kqyi" id="doc-paragraph">Une page <strong data-hf-id="hf-8q9s">bien structurée</strong> rend le contenu accessible.</p>
            <div data-hf-id="hf-vb6w" class="doc-columns">
              <div data-hf-id="hf-1043"><div data-hf-id="hf-lv0o" class="check-list" id="doc-list"><p data-hf-id="hf-8v9h"><span data-hf-id="hf-ls52">✓</span> Définir un titre</p><p data-hf-id="hf-0m5l"><span data-hf-id="hf-wobe">✓</span> Organiser les sections</p><p data-hf-id="hf-jay5"><span data-hf-id="hf-x2mf">✓</span> Ajouter des ressources</p></div><table data-hf-id="hf-k7g9" id="doc-table"><thead data-hf-id="hf-zd89"><tr data-hf-id="hf-p3r7"><th data-hf-id="hf-7ldv">Balise</th><th data-hf-id="hf-b05o">Rôle</th></tr></thead><tbody data-hf-id="hf-bsvf"><tr data-hf-id="hf-ddj7"><td data-hf-id="hf-cbnm">&lt;h1&gt;</td><td data-hf-id="hf-ocad">Titre principal</td></tr><tr data-hf-id="hf-cz86"><td data-hf-id="hf-v5j1">&lt;p&gt;</td><td data-hf-id="hf-vcdw">Paragraphe</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
              
            </div>
            <pre data-hf-id="hf-5pzb" id="doc-code"><code data-hf-id="hf-3z85">&lt;main&gt;
  &lt;h1&gt;Ma première page&lt;/h1&gt;
